BOUNDARY-UNIFORMIZATION THEOREM TARGET
  For every primitive expanded-bank packet after q-witness and AP/GW exits:
    either residue+owner_support is theorem-exit exact,
    or the first failure is witnessed by one of:
      unit-height disk exit, endpoint-owner Menger cut, SC accessory debt,
      exact-period/BDH exceptional fiber, recursive chiral mirror debt,
      state-lift/H7 label, or a newly named finite residual.
  A quotient is proof-legal only if it preserves that sidecar, proves it
  irrelevant on the fiber, or resurrects it by an explicit cut/stability map.

